          "statement": "Let $k,V,B,Q$ be as in [[def-clifford-algebra-of-a-quadratic-space]], and let $\\bar v=i_Q(v)$. Then\n\n$$\\bar v\\bar w+\\bar w\\bar v=2B(v,w)1$$\n\nfor all $v,w\\in V$.",
          "status": "draft"
        },
        {
          "id": "lem-clifford-quotient-factorization",
          "kind": "lemma",
