          },
          "statement": "Let $q_Q:T_k(V)\\to\\mathrm{Cl}(V,Q)$ be the quotient map from [[def-clifford-algebra-of-a-quadratic-space]]. If $A$ is a unital associative $k$-algebra and $\\psi:T_k(V)\\to A$ is a unital $k$-algebra homomorphism satisfying $\\psi(j(v)^2-Q(v)1)=0$ for every $v\\in V$, then there is a unique unital $k$-algebra homomorphism $\\bar\\psi:\\mathrm{Cl}(V,Q)\\to A$ with $\\psi=\\bar\\psi\\circ q_Q$.",
