          "statement": "Let $k,V,B,Q$ be as in [[def-clifford-algebra-of-a-quadratic-space]], and let $A$ be a unital associative $k$-algebra. For every $k$-linear map $f:V\\to A$ satisfying $f(v)^2=Q(v)1_A$ for all $v\\in V$, there is a unique unital $k$-algebra homomorphism $\\bar f:\\mathrm{Cl}(V,Q)\\to A$ such that $\\bar f\\circ i_Q=f$.",
