          "statement": "Assume AC. Let $N,M$ be connected nonempty compact oriented smooth three-manifolds with their external boundary parametrizations and vertical product collar fixed. Let $W$ be a connected compact oriented four-bordism between them. Suppose two specified all-two-handle presentations of $W$ are joined by the finite index-grouped based mixed-handle movie of [[lem-index-grouped-relative-descending-paths-give-based-framed-handle-movies]], with its actual terminal maps. Their framed links in $N$ are related by finite exterior framed isotopies and $O2/O3$ moves. The cumulative outgoing map is the comparison prescribed by that marked movie, up to isotopy fixed on the protected collar. Here $O2$ is the specified framed component band slide; $O3$ inserts or deletes an arbitrary framed knot and its small disk-zero meridian. Intermediate four-dimensional traces may change by the displayed interior surgeries. No assumption that diffeomorphic four-dimensional two-handlebodies are two-equivalent is made. The construction works componentwise with a fixed matching component partition.",
          "statement_or_definition": "Assume AC. Let $N,M$ be connected nonempty compact oriented smooth three-manifolds with their external boundary parametrizations and vertical product collar fixed. Let $W$ be a connected compact oriented four-bordism between them. Suppose two specified all-two-handle presentations of $W$ are joined by the finite index-grouped based mixed-handle movie of [[lem-index-grouped-relative-descending-paths-give-based-framed-handle-movies]], with its actual terminal maps. Their framed links in $N$ are related by finite exterior framed isotopies and $O2/O3$ moves. The cumulative outgoing map is the comparison prescribed by that marked movie, up to isotopy fixed on the protected collar. Here $O2$ is the specified framed component band slide; $O3$ inserts or deletes an arbitrary framed knot and its small disk-zero meridian. Intermediate four-dimensional traces may change by the displayed interior surgeries. No assumption that diffeomorphic four-dimensional two-handlebodies are two-equivalent is made. The construction works componentwise with a fixed matching component partition.",
