          "statement": "Let $\\mathcal C$ be a braided fusion category and let $A,B$ be separable algebra objects, with bimodule sections $\\sigma_A,\\sigma_B$. Give $A\\otimes B$ the braided tensor-product algebra structure from [[thm-braided-category-tensor-product-algebra-structure]]. A separability section is\n$$\\sigma_{A\\otimes B}=(1_A\\otimes c_{B,A}^{-1}\\otimes1_B)\\circ(\\sigma_A\\otimes\\sigma_B):A\\otimes B\\longrightarrow(A\\otimes B)\\otimes(A\\otimes B).$$\nThis is an $A\\otimes B$-bimodule map and its composite with multiplication is the identity.",
