          "statement": "For separable algebra objects in a finite semisimple monoidal category, take objects to be separable algebras, 1-morphisms $A\\to B$ to be $A$-$B$ bimodules, and 2-morphisms to be bimodule maps. Composition is $X\\circ Y=X\\otimes_B Y$ with order fixed so $X:A\\to B$ and $Y:B\\to D$ compose as $X\\otimes_B Y:A\\to D$. This composition has canonical associators and unitors satisfying the bicategory pentagon and interchange equations; its units are the regular bimodules $_AA_A$.",
