          "statement": "Let $G$ be a finite group and let $\\omega:G^4\\to\\mathbb C^\\times$ be a normalized group 4-cocycle. The convolution structure and scalar pentagonator of [[def-four-cocycle-twisted-monoidal-structure-on-2vect-g]] make $2\\mathrm{Vect}^{\\omega}_G$ a fusion 2-category. Its simple-object equivalence classes are exactly $\\delta_g$ for $g\\in G$, where $\\delta_g$ is $\\mathrm{Vect}_{\\mathbb C}$ concentrated in grade $g$. The monoidal unit $\\delta_e$ is simple. Every 1-morphism has left and right adjoints, every separable monad splits, and every object has left and right duals.",
