          "statement": "In the ungraded component of $2\\mathrm{Vect}_G$, identify $\\mathrm{Vect}_{\\mathbb C}^2$ with pairs of vector spaces. A linear functor is a $2\\times2$ matrix of finite-dimensional vector spaces, and composition is matrix multiplication using direct sums and tensor products.",
