          ],
          "statement": "In a chosen 2+1-dimensional defect theory modeled by a fusion 2-category, label objects $A,B,C$ as surface defects, 1-morphisms $f:A\\to B$ and $g:B\\to C$ as line junctions, and 2-morphisms $\\alpha:f\\Rightarrow f'$ as point junctions. This is a type dictionary conditional on that chosen theory, not a theorem identifying every algebraic object with a physical defect.",
