          ],
          "statement": "Work in the braided fusion category $\\mathrm{Vec}_{\\mathbb C}$ of finite-dimensional complex vector spaces, with ordinary tensor product and flip braiding. Let $R=\\mathbb C\\times\\mathbb C$ with orthogonal idempotents $e_1,e_2$. For $i,j\\in\\{1,2\\}$ let $M_{ij}=\\mathbb C$ with left action through the $i$th coordinate and right action through the $j$th coordinate.",
