            "def-group"
          ],
          "statement": "Write $C_4=\\mathbb Z/4\\mathbb Z$ additively, with elements $0,1,2,3$. Define the normalized 3-cochain\n$$\\beta(g,h,k)=\\begin{cases}-1,&(g,h,k)=(1,1,1),\\\\1,&\\text{otherwise}.\\end{cases}$$\nLet $\\omega=\\delta\\beta$, with the multiplicative coboundary convention in [[thm-three-cochain-gauge-equivalence-2vect-g]].",
