          "statement": "Take $G=\\{e\\}$. A $G$-graded finite semisimple category is just a finite semisimple $\\mathbb C$-linear category. There is only one normalized 4-cochain, hence only one normalized 4-cocycle, and its pentagonator is the identity.",
